♫ In our next lives ♫

1756
02:02:13.000 --> 02:02:15.792
♫ May it so be ♫

1757
02:02:15.875 --> 02:02:18.000
♫ That I'm born as you ♫

1758
02:02:18.083 --> 02:02:21.333
♫ And you'll be me ♫

1759
02:02:22.250 --> 02:02:26.667
♫ But we live only once ♫

